Subject: [PATCH] RESTRICT AUTOMERGE: Fix remote DoS in decodeWapPdu
 (b/517376969)

Catch RuntimeException during WAP push PDU decoding and SMS broadcast
to prevent persistent crash loops. If decoding fails, log a warning and
delete the poison tracker from the raw database.
Also add warning logs if inboundSmsTracker is null during broadcast.
Added corresponding unit tests in WapPushOverSmsTest and GsmInboundSmsHandlerTest.

